  - m_Id: 4717535380
    m_Localized: "A hang- \xE9s ir\xE1ny\xEDt\xE1si be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sok automatikusan
      ment\u0151dnek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535381
    m_Localized: "Ir\xE1ny\xEDt\xE1s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535382
    m_Localized: "Kiseg\xEDt\u0151 lehet\u0151s\xE9gek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535383
    m_Localized: "J\xE1t\xE9k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535384
    m_Localized: "K\xE9p"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535385
    m_Localized: "\xC1ll\xEDtsd k\xE9nyelmesre"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535386
    m_Localized: "F\u0151 hanger\u0151"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535387
    m_Localized: "J\xE1rm\u0171- \xE9s ment\xE9si effektek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535388
    m_Localized: Zene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535389
    m_Localized: "K\xF6rnyezet"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535390
    m_Localized: "Kezel\u0151fel\xFClet"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535391
    m_Localized: "F\xE9nyer\u0151"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535392
    m_Localized: "Min\u0151s\xE9g "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535393
    m_Localized: "A Teljes\xEDtm\xE9ny cs\xF6kkenti a r\xE9szleteket. A Min\u0151s\xE9g
      t\xF6bbet tart meg. Alkalmazd az el\u0151n\xE9zethez."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535394
    m_Localized: "Teljes k\xE9perny\u0151"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535395
    m_Localized: "Ablakos m\xF3d"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535396
    m_Localized: "Megtartod a k\xE9pbe\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sokat? Meger\u0151s\xEDt\xE9s
      n\xE9lk\xFCl 15 m\xE1sodperc ut\xE1n vissza\xE1llnak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535397
    m_Localized: "Felbont\xE1s "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535398
    m_Localized: "Megtartod a k\xE9pbe\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sokat? Meger\u0151s\xEDt\xE9s
      n\xE9lk\xFCl 15 m\xE1sodperc ut\xE1n vissza\xE1llnak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535399
    m_Localized: "A k\xE9pm\xE9retet a konzol hat\xE1rozza meg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535400
    m_Localized: "K\xE9pbe\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sok alkalmaz\xE1sa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535401
    m_Localized: " Ir\xE1ny\xEDt\xE1s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535402
    m_Localized: "Nyomj meg egy gombot. Esc: m\xE9gse."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535403
    m_Localized: "V\xE1lassz m\u0171veletet a gomb \xE1t\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1s\xE1hoz.
      Egy gombhoz csak egy m\u0171velet tartozhat. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535404
    m_Localized: "V\xE1lassz m\u0171veletet a gomb \xE1t\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1s\xE1hoz.
      Egy gombhoz csak egy m\u0171velet tartozhat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535405
    m_Localized: "Kamera Y tengely\xE9nek megford\xEDt\xE1sa "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535406
    m_Localized: "Megford\xEDtja a kamera f\xFCgg\u0151leges mozg\xE1s\xE1t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535407
    m_Localized: "Kamera \xE9rz\xE9kenys\xE9ge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535408
    m_Localized: "Sz\xF6veg / HUD m\xE9rete"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535409
    m_Localized: "Cs\xF6kkentett mozg\xE1s "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535410
    m_Localized: "A k\xE9nyelem\xE9rt cs\xF6kkentsd a kamera \xE9s a men\xFCk mozg\xE1s\xE1t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535411
    m_Localized: "Fesz\xFClts\xE9gjelz\xE9sek "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535412
    m_Localized: "A k\xF6t\xE9lfeszess\xE9get sz\xEDnekkel \xE9s jelk\xE9pekkel is
      mutassa."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535413
    m_Localized: "Oktat\xE1si tippek "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535414
    m_Localized: "Helyzetf\xFCgg\u0151 tippeket mutat. A c\xE9lok \xE9s k\xF6t\xE9lfigyelmeztet\xE9sek
      l\xE1that\xF3k maradnak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535415
    m_Localized: "Kontrollerrezg\xE9s "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535416
    m_Localized: "Finom visszajelz\xE9s a k\xF6t\xE9lr\u0151l, cs\xF6rl\u0151r\u0151l,
      \xFCtk\xF6z\xE9sekr\u0151l \xE9s ment\xE9sekr\u0151l. B\xE1rmikor kikapcsolhat\xF3."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535417
    m_Localized: "Rezg\xE9s er\u0151ss\xE9ge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535418
    m_Localized: "J\xE1t\xE9kle\xEDr\xE1s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535419
    m_Localized: "Gyakorold a vezet\xE9st, k\xF6t\xE9lcsatlakoztat\xE1st, cs\xF6rl\u0151z\xE9st
      \xE9s \xE1tad\xE1st. A karriered v\xE1ltozatlan marad."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535420
    m_Localized: "Halad\xE1s t\xF6rl\xE9se"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535421
    m_Localized: "T\xF6rl\xF6d az \xF6sszes halad\xE1st? A p\xE9nz, j\xE1rm\u0171vek,
      felszerel\xE9s \xE9s \xF6ssze\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sok t\xF6rl\u0151dnek. A be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sok
      megmaradnak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535422
    m_Localized: "T\xF6rl\xF6d az \xF6sszes halad\xE1st? A p\xE9nz, j\xE1rm\u0171vek,
      felszerel\xE9s \xE9s \xF6ssze\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sok t\xF6rl\u0151dnek. A be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sok
      megmaradnak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535423
    m_Localized: "A halad\xE1s t\xF6rl\xE9se el\u0151tt l\xE9pj ki a j\xE1t\xE9kb\xF3l
      a f\u0151men\xFCbe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535424
    m_Localized: "Lap alap\xE9rt\xE9keinek vissza\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535425
    m_Localized: "Alap\xE9rt\xE9kek vissza\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sa "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535426
    m_Localized: " Vissza\xE1ll\xEDtod a lap alap\xE9rt\xE9keit? A karrierhalad\xE1s
      megmarad."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535427
    m_Localized: "Alap\xE9rt\xE9kek vissza\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535428
    m_Localized: "El\u0151z\u0151 lap"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535429
    m_Localized: "K\xF6vetkez\u0151 lap"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535430
    m_Localized: TOW TROUBLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535431
    m_Localized: "Ezeket a be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sokat k\xE9s\u0151bb is m\xF3dos\xEDthatod."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535432
    m_Localized: "\xC1ll\xEDtsd k\xE9nyelmesre"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535433
    m_Localized: "Ezeket a be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sokat k\xE9s\u0151bb is m\xF3dos\xEDthatod."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535434
    m_Localized: "V\xE1laszd ki els\u0151 j\xE1rm\u0171ved"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535435
    m_Localized: "A hanger\u0151ket k\xFCl\xF6n \xE1ll\xEDthatod. A vizu\xE1lis figyelmeztet\xE9sek
      megmaradnak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535436
    m_Localized: A grafika automatikusan igazodik ehhez a konzolhoz.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535437
    m_Localized: "Megtartod a k\xE9pbe\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sokat? Meger\u0151s\xEDt\xE9s
      n\xE9lk\xFCl 15 m\xE1sodperc ut\xE1n vissza\xE1llnak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535438
    m_Localized: "Csatlakoztass kontrollert a kioszt\xE1s megtekint\xE9s\xE9hez.
      A billenty\u0171zet \xE9s eg\xE9r tov\xE1bbra is haszn\xE1lhat\xF3."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535439
    m_Localized: "V\xE1lassz m\u0171veletet a gomb \xE1t\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1s\xE1hoz.
      Egy gombhoz csak egy m\u0171velet tartozhat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535440
    m_Localized: "A sz\xF6vegm\xE9ret \xE9s a kamera\xE9rz\xE9kenys\xE9g b\xE1rmikor
      m\xF3dos\xEDthat\xF3."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4717535441
    m_Localized: "A tippek seg\xEDtik a tanul\xE1st. A halad\xE1s vissza\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sa
      t\xF6rli a karriert \xE9s megtartja a be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sokat."
