    m_Localized: "Hasmagass\xE1g +15 cm \xB7 Terepfelf\xFCggeszt\xE9s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118248
    m_Localized: "Meger\u0151s\xEDtett k\xF6t\xE9l \xB7 26 kN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4730118249
    m_Localized: "Szak\xEDt\xE1si hat\xE1r: 26 kN. Vezess \xF3vatosan. H\xFAzz egyenletesen,
